  "summary": "The paper proposes optimized gate-based quantum circuits for computing the call option payoff function f_K(S)=max(S−K,0). Two implementations are presented: a space‑efficient version using n additional qubits with Toffoli-depth n, and a time‑efficient version using 2n−1 qubits with constant Toffoli-depth 1; detailed resource formulas for qubits, T-count (e.g., ~21n for some constructions), and T-depth are reported across several quantum adders and Toffoli decompositions.",
